Component 2: Connection Table
When connection arrives, LB stores it.
Think:
Java
Map<ConnectionId, Connection>
Not actual implementation, but conceptually.
________________________________________
Each connection contains:
Client IP
Client Port
Protocol
Creation Time
State
Selected Backend
Example:
Connection #1
IP:
103.24.x.x
Backend:
Server-2
State:
ACTIVE
________________________________________
