Failure Scenario 1
Application Server Dies
Server1 ❌
LB health check removes it.
Traffic goes to:
Server3

Users unaffected.
________________________________________
Failure Scenario 2
Database Dies
App1 ✅
App2 ✅
DB ❌

LB sees app healthy.
Requests still routed.
Users receive:
500 Internal Server Error

This is why deep health checks are important.
